  "notes": "Tailwind slate/blue design. Distinctive: 'Applies on Generate' clock badges mark parameters that take effect only on the big sticky blue Generate Diagram button; file rows show green check filename chips plus up/down reorder arrow buttons; a floating find-in-diagram bar (search features, All selector, regex checkbox, prev/next, Open, Clear) overlays the preview; bottom floating pill toolbar with Reset Layout, Layout edit, Canvas padding, Search toggle and zoom (+ 39% − Fit). Export toolbar (DPI select, SVG/Interactive SVG/PNG/PDF). Right-edge dark 'Editor' tab opens a docked panel with Legend/Features/Similarity groups tabs and feature list with visibility toggles. Live page initially shows an empty state (DNA icon, Open Gallery example / Learn with tutorials) before the session loads; capture shows loaded session. 17-language selector in header."
